# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — PRIORITY ADS AGENCY

Build a complete, professional, production-ready **ERP + CRM + HR + Attendance + Payroll + Reimbursement + Field Force + Project Management system** for **Priority Ads Agency**.

The system must be fully connected. Do not build the modules as separate disconnected systems. Data entered in one module should automatically be available wherever it is required in another module.

The application must have a modern, clean, professional UI with responsive desktop/tablet/mobile layouts, role-based dashboards, proper navigation, search, filters, tables, forms, validation, notifications and secure backend permissions.

