# 60. IMPORTANT BUSINESS RULES

1. Login automatically creates attendance check-in.
2. Logout automatically creates attendance check-out.
3. Working hours are calculated automatically.
4. Attendance rules are configurable.
5. Attendance corrections require authorization.
6. Field Force is a major integrated module.
7. Employees can record client/lead visits.
8. Field visits record start/end time and meeting information.
9. Field visits connect to CRM, projects and daily activity.
10. Field expenses connect to reimbursements.
11. Reimbursements require approval.
12. Reimbursement should remain separate from salary while being available as a payroll input where required.
13. Payslips must be generated using the official company letterhead.
14. Company logo and information must appear on official documents.
15. Client is optional for internal projects/tasks/activity.
16. Every major module must have a clear + Add button.
17. HR manages employees, designations, salary and HR records.
18. Managers see their team's work and attendance.
19. Project Managers see project-related work.
20. Employees update their own daily activity.
21. CRM and ERP must be connected.
22. Lead conversion must preserve history.
23. Client/project/task/invoice/payment relationships must be maintained.
24. All modules require appropriate search and filters.
25. Backend permissions are mandatory.
26. Sensitive employee and salary information must be protected.
27. Important changes must be audited.
28. Avoid duplicate data entry.
29. Use relationships between records instead of duplicating information.
30. All official PDFs must follow the **Priority Ads Agency letterhead format provided in the reference images**.

